<section class="section"><div class="container faq"><p class="eyebrow">Before you start</p><h2>A few useful details.</h2><details><summary>What happens after I send my request?</summary><p>We review your website and goals, then contact you to clarify the scope and next step. If you prefer to start a conversation yourself, use WhatsApp after submitting.</p></details><details><summary>Will I need to give access to my accounts?</summary><p>No account access is needed for this initial review. If deeper work would benefit from analytics or advertising data, we agree on the scope and access separately.</p></details><details><summary>What happens after the free review?</summary><p>You can use the recommendations to decide your next step. If you want help with deeper analysis or implementation, we can discuss a paid project with a defined scope.</p></details></div></section>
